During my time at Deutsche Telekom, I have had the privilege of working with some of the most talented, creative, and dedicated individuals I have ever met. I will always cherish the memories and experiences I gained here, and I will never forget the friendships and connections I made with all of you.

I am truly grateful for the guidance, support, and mentorship that I have received during my time here. The lessons I learned, both professionally and personally, will stay with me throughout my career and life.

As I prepare to embark on this new chapter in my career, I want to express my deepest appreciation for everything that  Deutsche Telekom has given me. It has been an honor and a privilege to be part of such a wonderful team.

Please keep in touch, and do not hesitate to reach out if there is anything I can do to help during this transition. I look forward to seeing all the great things that  Deutsche Telekom will accomplish in the future.

Thank you again for everything. You will always have a special place in my heart.
Best regards,

